  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your hatred for your ancient enemies is unending and without remorse.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Great Hatred<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your attack roll bonus against targets of your hatred racial trait is increased by 2 rather than by 1, and you apply your hatred bonus on saving throws against charm or fear effects used by such creatures. If you fail a saving throw against a charm or fear effect used by the object of your hatred, you can expend one use of mythic power as an immediate action to reroll the save.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc141\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
